Install Docker:
----------------
    1. First check your Windows version (winver)
    2. Enable WSL manually (since command not found)
        - Open PowerShell as Administrator and run:
            dism.exe /online /enable-feature /featurename:Microsoft-Windows-Subsystem-Linux /all /norestart
    3. Then enable Virtual Machine Platform:
        - Open PowerShell as Administrator and run:
            dism.exe /online /enable-feature /featurename:VirtualMachinePlatform /all /norestart
    4. Restart your system
    5. wsl --install
    6. Install Ubuntu from Microsoft Store or (wsl --install -d Ubuntu)
       wsl --install -d Ubuntu
    7. Set up your Linux username and password
           PS C:\WINDOWS\system32> wsl --install
